  "name": "basalt",
  "description": "A hazard checker, assembler and scheduler for NVIDIA consumer Blackwell (sm_120). Reads the 21-bit scheduling control word out of machine code it did not produce and decides whether it covers the program's data dependencies, on an architecture with no hardware interlock where a stall one cycle short returns a wrong answer silently.",
